# Optional OpenAI and Anthropic allowlist — one pattern per line.
#
# Syntax:
#   example.com     exact hostname match (case-insensitive, IDNA/A-label form)
#   *.example.com   one or more labels in place of the star; does NOT match
#                   the bare "example.com" — list that separately if wanted
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with "#" are ignored.
# Ports are not part of a pattern: v1 permits port 443 only.
# IP literals are never permitted, in a pattern or in a CONNECT request.

# OpenAI / Codex
api.openai.com
*.openai.com
chatgpt.com
*.chatgpt.com
*.oaistatic.com
*.oaiusercontent.com

# Anthropic / Claude Code
api.anthropic.com
*.anthropic.com
claude.ai
*.claude.ai
claude.com
*.claude.com
